Date: Sat, 13 Mar 2021 23:03:50 +0000
Subject: Re: some functions for running BUGS in parallel
Message-ID: <e37OQMkJ8H0.NqfI3v1lAwAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <e37OQMkJ8H0.QLSXnBz8BQAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
References: <e37OQMkJ8H0.J8pFdpb3BQAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com> <e37OQMkJ8H0.QLSXnBz8BQAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
